From: shuuri-labs <61762328+shuuri-labs@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: qcom_pm8150b_charger: report online as 0 or 1

ONLINE returned the raw USBIN_PLUGIN_RT_STS bit, so a plugged-in charger
read online=16. UPower rejects anything but 0/1 for its boolean, keeps the
charger offline and reports the battery as discharging while it charges.
---
--- a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_pm8150b_charger.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_pm8150b_charger.c
@@ -400,7 +400,7 @@
 		return rc;
 	}
 
-	*val = (stat & USBIN_PLUGIN_RT_STS_BIT);
+	*val = !!(stat & USBIN_PLUGIN_RT_STS_BIT);
 	return 0;
 }
 
